Deviations / decisions:
- Default "new" destination reuses a local project with the same slug, so re-runs don't create a second folder.
- Re-run matching uses Message-ID as well as X-Linear-Id (identifiers change when issues move teams).
- Unchanged issues under --existing update count as X-Skipped.
- Deterministic hash: FNV-1a 64 + splitmix64 avalanche (pinned in a unit test).
- Interactive prompts (TTY path) not yet checked by hand; live smoke test (#[ignore], needs LINEAR_API_KEY + LINEAR_SMOKE_TEAM) not yet run.

